    {
      "id": "0f6270bc-bae8-46ca-a03e-0372eae922aa",
      "title": "Observe a frase, escute o áudio e ligue o espanhol ao sentido em português.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "9b2bed7e-7aa0-458e-bc2a-1b47e09342cc",
          "textContent": "<p>Uma forma simples de dizer seu nome é:</p><p><strong>Me llamo Camila.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Meu nome é Camila.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/c74afd4ed1c64d94aa9926ebc2578885_b01-apresentacao-na-aula.png?Expires=1794099396&Signature=O~6a4HIE-xgP9P9pHfyD0i2j9NLUAacwvlwEQO9lVXevvuo0GGLK3icnO2A5sduzZfDzwlFbqSSsD9Q0sfzAL-Ni1TlOvI7h8B259129tR5M0A7q97jaWQ~6KIQQjpxRv5-auMZXU~ccKSgt45SPv8qAXYf8PxfhWrksCEIHcIQzPLtjQAr1khnHmVDngK7p724NIEvA8JzifNAaqiru3HlcH5yfM2tswnw19Y-deZH4xGeo0oPlYspM8KUirar8Lxrrh6MqxhW7Px~UONfoqkuOH8GruUnbWhWd2r2b6jpQ0Ky62LCAt5L74bxpm1fjFMMorUJKkcLlpLudWzzxoQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/bdbbc1194e17488cac00c1482571a2a2_b02-me-llamo-camila.mp3?Expires=1794099396&Signature=PvES2~V34E-iU4Pp1m3bgCxZxpXQjWX64R~LhBYV0l7vQnJKEM92qLnJrfpPWj-Puoe22mnhPKJLmJ-qPCADbegEtDokhTQJ~3FrYjORPIH4MLj2xkfpW-YAnu~aMBeFqb6OFM-Lfbfh5O8TJ4~KQrNx6vHovM56mc7l4H7wpHvlGgDumzm9CJaxbPLiO7I8GV8AJLWLYI2gzD8LtMotsu1Kii5zIBZ6ekWe27o2sBAJ2SsJr0zfMMupmr2NLIMfiMlgwqF1u-f7MlhsjI9hsKzgB80ivciJVHesaKoznCKarb8omqLTzx8-niMPveMfTMWi3qbhkdttRVB5JbemgA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
